ponents are citizens of different states and the amount in controversy) Tj0 -12.96 Td (exceeds $75,000. For example, a lawsuit based on a car accident usually involves state law.) Tj-0.24 -12.96 Td 92 Tz (Therefore, it is not a ''federal question'' case unless the plaintiff and all the defendants are) Tj0.24 -12.96 Td (citizens of different states.) Tj36.479 -25.92 Td (Diversity of citizenship can sometimes exist when one party to a lawsuit is a citizen of a) Tj-36.479 -12.96 Td 91 Tz (state and the opposing party is an alien \(someone who is not a citizen of the United States\) [28) Tj0.479 -12.96 Td 84 Tz (U.S.C. з 1332\(a\)\(2\)] or a foreign country [28 U.S.C. з 1332\(a\)\(4\)].) Tj35.28 -25.843 Td 92 Tz (There are) Tj/F1 12 Tf ( ) Tj/F0 12 Tf (two other) Tj/F1 12 Tf ( requirements) Tj/F0 12 Tf ( for) Tj/F1 12 Tf ( ) Tj/F0 12 Tf (suing in federal court when the case is based on) Tj0.24 -13.516 Td 88 Tz (diversity.) Tj0.72 -25.92 Td 93 Tz (1. If there is more than one plaintiff and/or more than one defendant, there must be) Tj-0.72 -12.96 Td (complete diversity of citizenship. This means that you may not live in the same state as) Tj0 -12.96 Td 94 Tz (any defendant. For example, you are a citizen of New York. If you are involved in a) Tj0 -12.96 Td 92 Tz (car accident with one person from New Jersey and one person from New York, you) Tj0 -12.96 Td 93 Tz (cannot sue in federal court. Since you are from the same state as one of the) Tj0 -12.96 Td (defendants, there is not complete diversity of citizenship. You may proceed in the) Tj0 -12.96 Td 91 Tz (appropriate state court.) Tj-0.24 -25.92 Td 94 Tz (2. The amount of damages in controversy must be more than $75,000. If the amount) Tj0 -12.96 Td 92 Tz (you seek to recover is $75,000.00 or less, you cannot file your action in federal court,) Tj0.24 -12.96 Td (even if there is complete diversity of citizenship.) Tj0.479 -25.92 Td (If you cannot satisfy both of these requirements, you cannot file your case in federal) Tj-0.479 -12.96 Td 87 Tz (court.) TjETendstreamendobj16 0 obj4066 endobj14 0 obj<</Type /Page/Parent 3 0 R/Resources << /ProcSet [ /PDF /Text ] /Font << /F0 8 0 R /F1 11 0 R >> >>/MediaBox [ 0 0 612 792 ]/Contents 15 0 R>>endobj18 0 obj<< /Length 19 0 R >>stream
